@startuml diagram3_sequence
!theme plain
autonumber "<b>[00]</b>"
title "PIC Code Activation & Real-time EMS Status Refresh - Sequence Diagram"

' --- STYLING & PALETTE (Linear/Stripe Enterprise) ---
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI, Inter, Arial, sans-serif"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam defaultFontColor #0F172A
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam arrowColor #4F46E5
skinparam arrowThickness 1.2

skinparam participant {
    BorderColor #4F46E5
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    FontColor #1E1B4B
    FontSize 12
    FontStyle bold
    BorderThickness 1.2
}

skinparam actor {
    BorderColor #4F46E5
    BackgroundColor #EEF2FF
    FontColor #1E1B4B
    FontSize 12
    FontStyle bold
}

skinparam database {
    BorderColor #10B981
    BackgroundColor #ECFDF5
    FontColor #065F46
    FontStyle bold
}

skinparam entity {
    BorderColor #3B82F6
    BackgroundColor #EFF6FF
    FontColor #1E40AF
    FontStyle bold
}

skinparam box {
    BorderColor #CBD5E1
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    FontColor #475569
}

skinparam note {
    BorderColor #F59E0B
    BackgroundColor #FEF3C7
    FontColor #92400E
    FontSize 11
}

' --- PARTICIPANTS ---
actor "PIC Reviewer\n(Code Master)" as PIC
box "Enterprise Web Application" #F8FAFC
    boundary "Frontend UI\n(React SPA / Tailwind)" as UI
    control "Backend Service\n(Node.js / Express API)" as API
    database "Enterprise Database\n(PostgreSQL / Prisma)" as DB
end box
entity "Master Code / EMS API\n(Enterprise SAP Gateway)" as EMS

== Sequence Flow 1: Active Code Request (Stop PO Resolution) ==

PIC -> UI : Clicks "✉️ Request Active Code (Master Code)"\nfor item `SP-2024-M08` [Stop PO 2 Yrs]
activate UI

UI -> UI : Optimistically render UI status badge:\n"Active Requested ⏳"
UI -> API : POST /api/v2/pic/active-code-request\n{ itemId: "SP-2024-M08", requestor: "PIC Specialist" }
activate API

API -> DB : Find Item Requisition by ID\n`prisma.sparePartRequest.findUnique(...)`
activate DB
DB --> API : Returns Item & Master Code context
deactivate DB

API -> EMS : POST /api/master-code/reactivation-ticket\n{\n  itemCode: "SP-2024-M08",\n  reason: "Line 05 Assembly Urgent Requirement",\n  targetLine: "Line 05 - Assembly"\n}
activate EMS

note over EMS
  <b>Enterprise Master Code Board:</b>
  Validates 2-year obsolescence clause.
  Creates formal Jira/SAP ticketing workflow
  and queues email notification to Master Data Admin.
end note

EMS --> API : 200 OK HTTP\n{\n  ticketNo: "MC-TICKET-9941",\n  status: "QUEUED_FOR_APPROVAL",\n  slaHours: 24\n}
deactivate EMS

API -> DB : Update Item Record\n`prisma.itemMaster.update({\n  codeStatus: "Active Requested ⏳",\n  ticketRef: "MC-TICKET-9941"\n})`
activate DB
DB --> API : Update Confirmed
deactivate DB

API --> UI : 200 OK HTTP JSON\n{\n  success: true,\n  message: "Reactivation ticket MC-TICKET-9941 dispatched"\n}
deactivate API

UI -> UI : Display Toast Notification:\n"Master Code Activation Sent: Dispatched ticket to Master Code Board"
UI --> PIC : Visual confirmation on Data Grid row
deactivate UI

== Sequence Flow 2: Real-time Manual EMS Catalog Synchronization ==

PIC -> UI : Clicks "🔄 Refresh Code Status (EMS)"\non Top Action Bar
activate UI

UI -> UI : Set Refresh Spinner state (isSyncing = true)
UI -> API : POST /api/v2/ems/sync-master-catalog\n{ batchLine: "ALL", filterInactive: true }
activate API

API -> DB : Query active & flagged Item Codes list\n`prisma.sparePartRequest.findMany({ select: { itemCode: true } })`
activate DB
DB --> API : List of [SP-2024-C01, SP-2024-M08, SP-2024-E12, SP-2024-B09, ...]
deactivate DB

API -> EMS : GET /api/v2/ems/item-status?codes=SP-2024-C01,SP-2024-M08,SP-2024-E12,SP-2024-B09
activate EMS

note over EMS
  <b>EMS Enterprise Catalog Engine:</b>
  Queries SAP Master Material Tables (MARA/MARC),
  retrieves latest active status, vendor RFQ index,
  and spot price updates from global ERP nodes.
end note

EMS --> API : 200 OK HTTP JSON Array\n[\n  { code: "SP-2024-M08", codeStatus: "Active (Synced Master)", unitPrice: 92 },\n  { code: "SP-2024-E12", codeStatus: "Active", priceRisk: true, unitPrice: 245 },\n  { code: "SP-2024-B09", codeStatus: "Stop PO", priceStatus: "Need Revise", unitPrice: 18.5 }\n]
deactivate EMS

API -> DB : Batch Upsert / Sync Transaction\n`prisma.$transaction([\n  prisma.itemMaster.updateMany(...),\n  prisma.auditLog.create(...)\n])`
activate DB
DB --> API : Transaction Committed (5 records updated)
deactivate DB

API --> UI : 200 OK HTTP JSON\n{\n  syncedCount: 5,\n  timestamp: "2026-10-05T23:14:00Z",\n  updatedItems: [...]\n}
deactivate API

UI -> UI : Update React Global State (`AppContext.items`)\nReset Spinner (isSyncing = false)
UI -> UI : Trigger Success Toast:\n"Master Code Synchronization Completed: Synced 5 codes from Master Code"
UI --> PIC : Data Grid re-renders with fresh badges & updated prices
deactivate UI

@enduml
